<!-- =====================================================================
  Spirit_Bash DASHBOARD — 100% client-side file tools
  Paste this whole block into a Blogger "HTML/JavaScript" gadget (Layout)
  or into a Page's HTML view. Nothing here needs a server — every
  conversion runs in the visitor's own browser using open-source JS
  libraries loaded from CDN below.

  WHAT ACTUALLY WORKS (real conversion happens):
    PDF: merge, split, extract/delete/reorder pages, rotate, page numbers,
         watermark, basic compress, remove metadata, PDF→JPG/PNG,
         PDF→Text, PDF→basic Word (text only), PDF→basic Excel (text only),
         Images→PDF
    Word: .docx→HTML, .docx→Text, .docx→PDF (formatting is approximate)
    Excel/CSV: csv⇄xlsx⇄json, cleaning (trim/dedupe/blank rows), viewer
    Images: compress, resize, format convert, rotate/flip, grayscale

  WHAT IS NOT INCLUDED (no reliable pure-browser way to do these):
    PowerPoint conversions, PDF password protect/remove, OCR.
    These genuinely need a server-side engine (LibreOffice/Ghostscript/
    OCR) — Blogger can't run one, so they're intentionally left out
    rather than faked.
===================================================================== -->

